>Smith</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cullinane</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Melacon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Psychological well being and quality of life in ovarian cancer survivors</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>2003a</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>1061</fpage><lpage>1071</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||98|1061||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12942576</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ferrell</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cullinane</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Melacon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Symptom concerns of women with ovarian cancer</article-title><source>J Pain Symptom Manage</source><year>2003b</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>528</fpage><lpage>538</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Pain Symptom Manage||25|528||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12782433</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ferrell</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ervin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Itano</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Melacon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A qualitative analysis of social concerns of women with ovarian cancer</article-title><source>Psychooncology</source><year>2003c</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>647</fpage><lpage>663</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Psychooncology||12|647||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14502590</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation c